      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Your shoulder launchers can carry a blast type too. A Launcher Warhead is a small charge: High Explosive, Heavy Slug, Incendiary and Phosphorus at HV and Demolition at EV for the Rocket Launcher and Grim Reaper; Grenade HE (HV) and Grenade Cluster (EV) for the Grenade Launcher; EMP (LuV) for the Nuke Launcher.\n\nCraft it with the launcher in the crafting grid for 4 charges, up to 16. Each shot spends one charge and the launcher\u0027s own round, and goes off as a small blast; its center damage is capped at 1.25 times the launcher\u0027s own. Make a High Explosive one; check NEI for its recipe.\n\n[warn]Keep your distance from the impact point: these rounds hurt you as much as your target.[/warn]",
